    "design_review": {
      "approved_by": "design-panel",
      "at": "2026-09-14T02:00:00Z",
      "self_resolved": [
        "SPEC-001 high: collapse mode never reaches the drawer element \u2014 threading it is now T014",
        "SPEC-002 high: narrow-only region is hidden under the never setting \u2014 explicit rule added to T015",
        "SPEC-003 high: characterisation tests cannot assert class strings \u2014 T013 now asserts computed visibility",
        "SPEC-004 high: stories share a bundle artifact and four modules \u2014 dispatch is sequential",
        "SPEC-005 high: the boosted-navigation task needed a payload from a later story \u2014 payload moved to T003",
        "SPEC-006 high: FR-006 unsatisfied as planned \u2014 the blocking script becomes the single definition, T005",
        "SPEC-007 medium: tests/test_views/test_account.py asserts the removed tags' output \u2014 added to T015",
        "ARCH-001 medium: the store must register after the persist plugin, not merely before Alpine starts",
        "ARCH-002 medium: the payload was planned for the template D4 rejected \u2014 moved to the drawer component",
        "SPEC-008 low: breakpoint_px returns 1024 under never and nothing asserts it \u2014 pinned in T002"
      ]
    },
    "review": {
      "approved_by": "reviewer",
      "at": "2026-09-15T02:00:00Z",
      "self_resolved": [
        "RVW-001 high: the Account Center layout depended on an ancestor attribute a project-owned base.html need not render \u2014 the row now carries it itself",
        "RVW-002 medium: two documentation passages said setting the breakpoint on <c-app> does not reach the navbar toggle, which is no longer true \u2014 corrected",
        "RVW-003 medium: the header forwarded a breakpoint and collapse mode the navbar no longer reads \u2014 removed, and the shipped skill's tables corrected",
        "RVW-004 medium: max-width complements left a gap at fractional viewport widths \u2014 all five now use the exact complement form",
        "RVW-005 medium: the store's default configuration described a state the server cannot produce \u2014 made consistent and pinned by a test",
        "RVW-006 low: the visibility classes set display:flex and sit outside the utility layer \u2014 documented",
        "RVW-007 low: the header's stuck state was not re-derived after a boosted navigation \u2014 fixed and tested",
        "RVW-008 low: two fixed sleeps and a store read before the store existed \u2014 replaced with waits on conditions",
        "RVW-009 low: two characterisation tests never exercised the drawer state they named \u2014 both now do",
        "RVW-010 low: the storage key was restated as a literal in the bundle \u2014 the fallback no longer persists at all"
      ]
    }
  },
